    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Entrance and Beguile Others</p></blockquote><p>An Enchanter's magic clouds or captivates minds. Some Enchanters use their abilities to encourage peace and soften cruelty, while others use their mind-altering magic for selfish ends.</p><h3>Enchanter Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.VrUfAZg4m3uTGQEo]{Enchanting Conversationalist}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.TKHW9PVo4qBQ4Efs]{Enchantment Savant}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.b6EaJkMY1Gy99WXv]{Hypnotic Presence}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bO3z4Uz9iRBOrXPB]{Split Enchantment}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.YlstgX3fjFqHhyZZ]{Instinctive Charm}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7QF4nhQ28hwmIwbl]{Alter Memories}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
